        {
          "id": 77811,
          "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; font-size: 16pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #ba372a;\"><strong> VOCABULARY: Everyday things </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #c0392b; font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>A. Things we do every day </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">1. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109241.mp3\" /> <strong>Wake up</strong>: Thức giấc </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">2. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109253.mp3\" /> <strong>Get up</strong>: Thức dậy</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">3. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109263.mp3\" /> <strong>Go to the bathroom</strong>: Đi vệ sinh </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">4. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109279.mp3\" /> <strong>Have a shower</strong>: Tắm (vòi hoa sen)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">5. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109292.mp3\" /> <strong>Have a bath:</strong> Tắm (bồn)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">6. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109303.mp3\" /> <strong>Go to work</strong>: Đi làm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">7. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109314.mp3\" /> <strong>Come/ Go/ Get home:</strong> Đi về nhà</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">8. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109325.mp3\" /> <strong>Make dinner</strong>: Làm bữa tối</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">9. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109336.mp3\" /> <strong>Phone (or call) a friend</strong>: Gọi điện cho bạn</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">10. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109351.mp3\" /> <strong>Watch TV</strong>: Xem tivi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">11. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709109368.mp3\" /><strong>Go to bed/ Go to sleep: </strong>đi ngủ</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #c0392b; font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>B. Sometimes I … </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><em>Giặt quần áo  <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709110452.mp3\" />     Lau nhà  <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709110466.mp3\" />             Đi dạo  <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709110486.mp3\" />        Viết thư/ email  <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1709110519.mp3\" /></em></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/images/1709110452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"510\" height=\"138\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #c0392b; font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>C. Expressions</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>A: </strong>How often do you read the newspaper / watch TV? <em>(Bạn có hay đọc báo/ xem ti vi không?)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>B: </strong>Three or four times a week. <em>(3 hoặc 4 lần 1 tuần)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>A: </strong>What time do you get up / go to work? <em>(Mấy giờ bạn ngủ dậy/ đi làm?)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>B: </strong>At 7 o'clock normally. <em>(Thường là 7 giờ)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>A: </strong>How do you go to work? <em>(Bạn đi làm bằng phương tiện gì?)</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>B: </strong>Usually by bus / train / car. <em>(Thường là xe buýt/ tàu/ ô tô)</em></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
