          "explain": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bài yêu cầu điền thông tin của cá nhân, nên thông tin thời gian tùy thuộc vào HV, không có câu trả lời sai. Cần chú ý cách viết thời gian đúng. </span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1. I usually get up at ……… .  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Suggested answer: &lt;specific time&gt;)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2. After that, I often go to the bathroom to have a ……… . </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Suggested answer: bath/shower)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3. After having breakfast, I go to work/school by ……… .  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Suggested answer: bus/train/car)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4. I come ……… at ………  o’clock after work/school. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Suggested answer: home; &lt;specific time&gt;)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #242938; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">5. I often watch ………  ……… times a week .  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;