t night, I often go to ……… at ……… . </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Suggested answer: sleep/bed; &lt;specific time&gt;)</span></span></p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-57a9b65c-7fff-d916-e19e-92ebac4113a4\" style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"></span></p>",
